{"id": "f1a9658c-e149-4f65-a868-e098b3581df7", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"text": "I'll scope this out: this requires enumerating all RDS/Aurora instances and clusters across engines, checking each engine version's support status (which requires cross-referencing AWS's deprecation timelines), and compiling a grouped report. This is a token-heavy survey task, so I'll hand the data-gathering to a research pass, then build the artifact.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "tooluse_3x2hVbPsDNFJrVkxuPAzEJ", "tool_name": "gather_context", "input": {"prompt": "{
  "task": "Run a read-only RDS/Aurora upgrade-readiness audit across ALL engines in account 012345678901_1, region us-east-1.",
  "context": "User wants a full inventory of every RDS instance and Aurora cluster in this account/region, with engine version and AWS support status for each, grouped by engine (mysql, postgres, aurora-mysql, aurora-postgresql, mariadb, sqlserver-*, oracle-*, etc). Flag any that are deprecated or approaching end of standard support, and recommend an upgrade target version for each flagged one.",
  "resources": ["RDS DB instances", "RDS DB clusters (Aurora)", "describe_db_instances", "describe_db_clusters", "describe_db_engine_versions"],
  "timeframe": "current state as of 2026-10-09",
  "criteria": "For each DB instance/cluster collect: identifier, engine, engine version, instance class, multi-AZ, storage, status. Use describe_db_engine_versions (with the engine and the specific version) to check if the version is deprecated or has a known end-of-standard-support / end-of-life date in AWS docs. Group all databases by engine family. For each DB that is on a deprecated or soon-to-be-deprecated version, recommend the next supported/stable engine version to upgrade to (check describe_db_engine_versions for valid upgrade targets via ValidUpgradeTarget). Return a structured summary: total DB count, counts per engine, and a flagged list with current version, status (deprecated/approaching EOL/supported), and recommended target version per DB."
}"}, "type": "tool_use", "display_intent": "Survey all RDS/Aurora databases in us-east-1 and check engine version support status."}], "created_at": null}
